==Format==
* '''The New Legends Stage:''' ''October 30th - November 2nd, 2021''
** 16 Team Swiss System Format
*** Round 1 and 2 are seeded using the {{Abbr|RMR|Regional Major Rankings}} Standings
*** Rounds 3 to 5 are seeded using the {{Abbr|Buchholz system|Ranking based on opponents' performance}}
*** Elimination and Advancement matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
*** All other matches are {{Abbr/Bo1}}
** Top 8 Teams proceed to '''[[PGL/2021/Stockholm/Champions Stage|The New Champions Stage]]'''
** Bottom 8 Teams are eliminated
** {{Swiss Explained|width=790px|margin=45px|seeding=
** The initial match-ups are seeded using the {{Abbr|RMR|Regional Major Rankings}} Standings}}

